# Token / model usage

- **Only the Auto model** may be used for this project’s agent work.
- **Premium / paid high-tier models are forbidden** (do not switch to or recommend Opus, GPT-5 Pro, Claude premium tiers, “max”, “thinking-high” paid SKUs, etc. for AlarmApp tasks).
- Prefer the smallest sufficient context: read targeted files; avoid dumping entire `docs/` trees unless needed.
- Do not spawn unnecessary parallel subagents or re-read large files already summarized in `memory.md`.
- Before long exploratory passes, check `memory.md` and phase plans first.
- If a task seems to “need” a premium model, refuse the switch and continue with Auto — ask the human only if blocked on capability, not for a model upgrade.
